---
// Vercel Web Analytics for the Astro-rendered pages (fleet, hubs, trackers, tsa, news, 404, …).
// The dashboard (public/index.html) loads the same script inline. Until Sep 2026 these pages only
// carried Speed Insights — which was canceled on the project in Jul 2026 — so every non-dashboard
// page was invisible in Web Analytics (requestPath breakdown showed "/" alone).
// `is:inline` keeps Astro from bundling it; the script is served by Vercel per deployment.
// CSP: script-src allows https://va.vercel-scripts.com (vercel.json).
---
<script is:inline defer src="/_vercel/insights/script.js"></script>
